  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation of the &quot;Global South Centre for Mediation&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall goal: Enhancing the engagement and capacities of developing and emerging countries in international mediation. The creation of the Mediation Centre is a response to several UN initiatives, where new countries such as Brazil have engaged actively in the area of peace and reconciliation. Norway wishes to increase its collaboration with these new players. In cooperation with BRICS Policy Center in Rio de Janeiro.</narrative>
  </description>
